### Criar subscription webhook Business Central
POST https://api.businesscentral.dynamics.com/v2.0/{{tenantId}}/{{environment}}/api/v2.0/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{BC_ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notificationUrl": "https://api.example.com/webhooks/business-central",
  "resource": "companies({{companyId}})/salesInvoices",
  "clientState": "{{BC_WEBHOOK_CLIENT_STATE}}"
}
